<title>JAPAN: Nippon Synthetic - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Synthetic - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.09		vs	   27.88</p>
<p> Operating	  737    million    vs	    1.19</p>
<p> Current	    702    million    vs	    1.13</p>
<p> Net		  404    million    vs	  561    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.91 yen	  vs	    6.36 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    103 million	  vs	  88 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Synthetic Chemical Industry Co Ltd is a leading maker of polyvinyl alcohol.</p>
